y="false" data-math-source="A\mathrel{+}=S"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A\mathrel{+}=S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel"><span class="mord">+</span></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.3669em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0576em;">S</span></span></span></span></span><span>, and CLEAR </span><span data-math-display="false" data-math-source="S"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0576em;">S</span></span></span></span></span><span> with certificate </span><span data-math-display="false" data-math-source="S=A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S=A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0576em;">S</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span></span><span>. The final public matrix is the identity.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Thus even correct public-only certificates at every CLEAR and full final public rank do not imply full public-only rank immediately after every CLEAR.</span></p><h3 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>Public-only certificate checks remain separate</span></h3><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>For all 204 records, require valid integer provider indices</span></p><span class="Display-XTzqIm" data-math-display="true" data-math-source="0\le r&lt;1501,"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1501</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\le r&lt;1501,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≤</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0278em;">r</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&lt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">1501</span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span></span><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto">